===Profanity/Insult===
{{en-Vulgar}}

# A term of insult, created by Curtis Machen, aged 14. "While playing a Tomb Raider: Anniversary on the Wii console I had to collect Ankhs as keys for a door.. I began laughing as it also sounded like an insult.. Now I call everyone it! I make it the equivilant to calling someone a Tw**. As wierd as it may sound for someone of my age, I think its a great creation; and all profanities have to start somewhere!". Known as the equivilant of a "Tw**" (V).
